  "thesis": "The latest published Nasdaq Composite trend may expose institutional technology-equity risk appetite before a BTC position decision. Holding full BTC only while the Nasdaq close is strictly above the simple mean of its prior 200 valid business-day closes may avoid externally visible risk-off paths and improve drawdown and Calmar after costs while retaining sufficient upside.",
